  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Ice_Orok_Juggernaut.png\" title=\"Ice Orok Juggernaut\"><img alt=\"Ice Orok Juggernaut\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"231\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Ice_Orok_Juggernaut.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Ice_Orok_Juggernaut.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Ice Orok Juggernaut</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race: </b> Orok\n</p><p><b>Class: </b>Giant Fighter\n</p><p>Juggernauts are freakishly large Oroks armed with an immense log.  These surly giants walk around hefting their huge pieces of timbers and only take it off their shoulder to swat and knock their opponents down.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Juggernaut\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Storerooms</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Orok Juggernaut\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Juggernaut\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td>  \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cave Yetti\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Clan of the Cave Yetti</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Juggernaut\n</td><td> --\n</t